<title>RUSSIA: Russia's FESCO buying land under its premises.</title>
<headline>Russia's FESCO buying land under its premises.</headline>
<dateline>VLADIVOSTOK, Russia 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia's Far Eastern Shipping Company (FESCO) has started buying the land under its premises, a FESCO official said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Local privatisation officials said the necessary papers for FESCO (OAO Dalnevostochnoye Morskoye Parokhodstvo (DVMP)) to purchase three plots under its Vladivostok premises were ready.</p>
<p>The three plots total 2,400 square meters and cost 83 million roubles.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
</text>
